# Files `helm package` leaves out of the chart's .tgz (it packages
# everything not listed here). The render tests and their profiles live
# beside the chart but never ship inside it, nor do the vendored
# opamp-server chart's own (its .helmignore applies only when it is
# packaged alone).
tests/
charts/opamp-server/tests/
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.bak
*.tmp
*.orig
*~
